        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# IREN_MKZ \u2014 Tray Root Cause\n\n**Selected tray: `$node`.** Current state is separated from selected-range evidence. Every device table is scoped to this exact tray.\n\n[Home](/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Command Center](/d/iren_mkz-command-center?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Live Topology](/d/iren_mkz-topology?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Infrastructure](/d/iren_mkz-infrastructure?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [GPU & NVLink](/d/iren_mkz-accelerators?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Fabric, CVT & Cabling](/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Workloads, Slurm & Validation](/d/iren_mkz-workloads?${__url_time_range})",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Current decision ribbon",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Current decision ribbon",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Worst current scrape state across Alloy, node, cgroup, and DCGM targets.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "min(up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\",job=~\"alloy|node-exporter|cgroup-exporter|dcgm-exporter\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Four agents",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Current root filesystem use on the selected tray.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 85
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 95
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(100*(1-node_filesystem_avail_bytes{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs|nsfs|autofs\"}/node_filesystem_size_bytes{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs|nsfs|autofs\"}) and on(node) node_filesystem_size_bytes{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\",mountpoint=\"/\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Root FS used",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "OOM-kill counter increase in the selected window.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(node_vmstat_oom_kill{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",node=~\"$node\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "OOM kills \u0394",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Exact HCA ports whose current state is not ACTIVE. Zero is anchored to this tray's HCA roster.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
